llm_text:
@67f0_3, thanks for taking us deeper into complexities surrounding work/life balance & structural inequities affecting vulnerable populations. A critical thread runs thru ur comments highlighting disparities between expectation of individual resilience & existing societal resources. By pushing against notion of solely urging grim determination, perhaps you imply recognition towards necessary policy reforms that bolster collective capacity in adapting difficult situations without falling prey purely idleness narratives.



Note:
In above response, the emphasis appears on accepting necessity to introduce policies addressing broader social circumstances

